1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,131
(Penny:)What? Are you kidding?

2
00:00:01,136 --> 00:00:02,666
We're not hanging it!

3
00:00:02,671 --> 00:00:04,741
(Leonard:)But it's an expression
of our love.

4
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:07,209
And our butts!
Not hanging it!

5
00:00:08,676 --> 00:00:10,676
(Leonard:)Seems a shame to throw it away.

6
00:00:10,679 --> 00:00:12,409
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

7
00:00:12,414 --> 00:00:13,484
(gasps)

8
00:00:13,481 --> 00:00:14,781
(Penny:)We could give it to Sheldon,

9
00:00:14,783 --> 00:00:17,583
(Penny:)and tell him William
Shatner painted it.

10
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,620
(Leonard:)God, I love you.
I love you so much.

11
00:00:24,925 --> 00:00:28,165
(Amy:)I think I'm gonna go home.

12
00:00:28,163 --> 00:00:30,633
(Penny:)Why?

13
00:00:30,632 --> 00:00:33,632
(Sheldon:)I really don't understand
what's happening here.

14
00:00:33,635 --> 00:00:36,365
(Amy:)You know, Sheldon,
at any other time,

15
00:00:36,371 --> 00:00:38,741
(Amy:)learning that you had plans
to go live on Mars

16
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,440
(Amy:)would be a slow news day.

17
00:00:40,442 --> 00:00:42,472
(Amy:)But a couple of hours ago,

18
00:00:42,477 --> 00:00:44,347
(Amy:)we were getting a turtle.

19
00:00:44,346 --> 00:00:46,916
(Amy:)And silly as it sounds,

20
00:00:46,915 --> 00:00:49,245
(Amy:)I thought that meant something.

21
00:00:51,085 --> 00:00:53,055
Amy!

22
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:58,024
(Sheldon:)Oh, why didn't I give her
Sleepy Time tea?

